# OBMC GATE: the three red p0 cells lost OBMC blocks to WARPED_CAUSAL, which C codes too (2026-09-26)

commit:  main at 9b9821bb (port "now"); 606c4accd^ (port "before")
host:    i265 (Core Ultra 7 265K, 20 threads, 30 GiB, native Linux)
oracle:  mainline-4.2.0 (C column)
cells:   the obmc_gate.sh p0 cells, derf rawseq clips, cli_qp 40, 2 frames,
         flat low-delay P (port: SVTAV1_INTRA_PERIOD=64 SVTAV1_HIER_LEVELS=0;
         C: SVT_INTRA_PERIOD=-1 SVT_HIER_LEVELS=0)
counts:  port = `mm=` lines of SVTAV1_INTERDBG; C = `mm=` lines of
         SVT_CINTER_OUT (the motion_mode_census.sh method)

| cell         | port before: obmc / warped / all | port now: obmc / warped / all | C: obmc / warped / all |
|--------------|----------------------------------|-------------------------------|------------------------|
| vidyo3 256   | 138 (44%) / 0 / 314              | 118 (40%) / 82 (28%) / 296    | 292 (30%) / 250 (26%) / 959 |
| vidyo1 256   |  80 (43%) / 0 / 188              |  58 (32%) / 24 (13%) / 180    | 230 (29%) /  46 (6%) / 802  |
| vidyo3 128   |  62 (56%) / 0 / 110              |  40 (47%) / 24 (28%) /  86    | 108 (33%) /  51 (16%) / 323 |

Reading: before 606c4accd (wm_level-1 warp injection) the port coded NO
warped block at preset 0, where C codes WARPED_CAUSAL on 6-26 % of inter
blocks. The injection made warped reachable; the OBMC count fell by 20-22 on
each cell as blocks moved to warped, and both shares moved toward C's.
Recon == dav1d held 2/2 on every cell in CI run 36203734807. The port's
partition tree still differs from C's at p0 (296 vs 959 coded blocks), so C's
absolute counts are not the gate's contract (see the gate header).

The earlier count "80" for vidyo1 256 before the change is the port's count at
606c4accd^; the gate pinned 76 (its 2026-09-20 measurement).

## Second re-pin, same day: bipred 3x3 compound injection (da18c6b8)

Measured at main da29e74a (i265, same cells, 2 frames, qp 40, p0). Port
before = main at 2946d5e5 (the counts above). Shares of coded inter blocks:

| cell       | OBMC before -> now (C) | warped now (C) | compound before -> now (C) | port blocks / C blocks |
