| vidyo3 256 | 40% -> 34% (30%)       | 22% (26%)      | 0% -> 11% (12%)            | 290 / 959              |
| vidyo1 256 | 32% -> 31% (28%)       | 13% (5%)       | 0% -> 10% (13%)            | 158 / 802              |
| vidyo3 128 | 47% -> 25% (33%)       | 13% (15%)      | 0% -> 38% (19%)            | 88 / 323               |
| johnny 256 | 17% -> 10% (14%)       | 4% (3%)        | 0% -> 10% (22%)            | 92 / 528               |

OBMC counts 118/58/12/40 -> 100/50/10/22. The
compound share moved from none toward C's on every cell and overshoots on
vidyo3 128; OBMC's share moved toward C's on the two 256 cells and past it
on vidyo3 128 and johnny. Recon == aomdec == dav1d on every cell (CI run on
da18c6b8). Floors re-pinned to 100/50/10/22 with owner approval.
